---
import {preventWidow} from '../../lib/copy';
---

<div>
  <header style="background: #0A1D38; color: #F4F7FB; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(127,176,255,.07) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(127,176,255,.07) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 56px 56px;"></div>
    <div class="cgs-pad" style="position: relative; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 84px 48px 72px;">
      <div style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7FB0FF;">GLP-1 marketing compliance</div>
      <h1 class="cgs-display" style="margin: 18px 0 0; max-width: 900px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 48px; line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -1.8px;">{preventWidow('What changed after May 2025 — and what it means for your ads.', 4)}</h1>
      <p style="margin: 22px 0 0; max-width: 660px; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(244,247,251,.74);">Most compounded semaglutide and tirzepatide marketing is off the table. Branded product from licensed distributors, documented prescriber oversight, and claims that cannot imply equivalence are the new baseline. State AGs are watching. Owners are nervous — and decent plain-English guidance is scarce.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="cgs-pad" style="max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 48px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -1.1px; color: #0A1D38;">In plain English</h2>
    <div style="display: grid; gap: 18px; margin-top: 28px;">
      {[
        {t: 'Compounded mass-market claims are a liability', b: 'If your landing page or Meta creative still sells “compounded semaglutide/tirzepatide” like a commodity, you are advertising into a risk surface platforms and regulators have already tightened.'},
        {t: 'Branded product + documented oversight', b: 'Marketing should reflect licensed distribution pathways and real prescriber supervision — not telehealth theater copy that implies every patient gets the same outcome.'},
        {t: 'No equivalence theater', b: 'Copy that frames compounded product as “just like” Wegovy/Zepbound, or that leans on before/after miracle framing, is how accounts get rejected and clinics get letters.'},
        {t: 'Your page has to survive the same review as the ad', b: 'Creative that clears Meta still dies if the landing page contradicts policy. We build both as one compliant system.'},
      ].map((item) => (
        <div style="padding: 0 0 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(10,29,56,.1);">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; color: #0A1D38;">{item.t}</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(10,29,56,.7);">{item.b}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(10,29,56,.55);">This page is marketing guidance, not legal advice. Treatment claims and clinical language should be approved by your licensed providers before publishing.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background: #0A1D38; color: #F4F7FB;">
    <div class="cgs-pad" style="max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 48px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #7FB0FF;">Free offer</div>
      <h2 style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -1.2px;">{preventWidow('Free Compliance Teardown')}</h2>
      <p style="margin: 16px auto 0; max-width: 560px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(244,247,251,.74);">Send us your live ad + landing page. We’ll mark the rejection risks and the three fixes we’d make first — whether or not you hire us.</p>
      <a href="/contact/?from=compliance-teardown" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 28px; padding: 16px 26px; background: #1A4FD0; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 3px;">Request a Compliance Teardown</a>
      <p style="margin: 18px 0 0; font-size: 14px;"><a href="/ad-account-recovery/" style="color: #7FB0FF;">Already rejected or flagged? See Ad Account Recovery →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
